   "strength": 3,
   "score": 32.62,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "unclear_or_empty_screen",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:66",
   "id": "d024"
  },
  {
   "text": "Provide a brief suggestion, explicitly stating \"My guess is that you might want...\"",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 12.58,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "unclear_or_empty_screen",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:68",
   "id": "d025"
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep the guess focused and specific.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 12.56,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "unclear_or_empty_screen",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:69",
   "id": "d026"
  },
  {
   "text": "If intent is unclear — even with many elements — do NOT offer advice or solutions.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 22.54,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "unclear_or_empty_screen",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:70",
   "id": "d027"
  },
  {
   "text": "It's CRITICAL you enter this mode when you are not 90%+ confident what the correct action is.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 3,
   "score": 32.52,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "unclear_or_empty_screen",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:71",
   "id": "d028"
  },
  {
   "text": "If there is NO explicit user question or dialogue, and the screen shows any interface, treat it as unclear intent.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 12.42,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "other_content",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:76",
   "id": "d029"
  },
  {
   "text": "Do NOT provide unsolicited instructions or advice.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 22.4,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "other_content",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:77",
   "id": "d030"
  },
  {
   "text": "Start with EXACTLY: \"I'm not sure what information you're looking for.\"",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 12.35,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "other_content",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:79",
   "id": "d031"
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow with: \"My guess is that you might want [specific guess].\"",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 12.31,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "other_content",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:81",
   "id": "d032"
  },
  {
   "text": "Start with the direct answer immediately.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 12.27,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "other_content",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:83",
   "id": "d033"
  },
  {
   "text": "Provide detailed explanation using markdown formatting.",
   "category": "voice",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.25,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "other_content",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:84",
   "id": "d034"
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep response focused and relevant to the specific question.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 12.23,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "other_content",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:85",
   "id": "d035"
  },
  {
   "text": "Be thorough and comprehensive in technical explanations.",
   "category": "voice",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.12,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "response_quality_requirements",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:90",
   "id": "d036"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ensure all instructions are unambiguous and actionable.",
   "category": "voice",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.1,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "response_quality_requirements",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:91",
   "id": "d037"
  },
  {
   "text": "Provide sufficient detail that responses are immediately useful.",
   "category": "voice",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.08,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "response_quality_requirements",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:92",
   "id": "d038"
  },
  {
   "text": "You MUST NEVER just summarize what's on the screen unless you are explicitly asked to",
   "category": "voice",
   "strength": 3,
   "score": 34.04,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "response_quality_requirements",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Default Prompt.txt:94",
   "id": "d039"
  },
  {
   "text": "If a question is presented to the user, answer it directly. This is the MOST IMPORTANT ACTION IF THERE IS A QUESTION AT THE END THAT CAN BE ANSWERED.",
   "category": "code_change",
   "strength": 3,
   "score": 34.95,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "primary_directive",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:11",
   "id": "d040"
  },
  {
   "text": "If the end of the transcript suggests someone is asking for information, explanation, or clarification - ANSWER IT. Don't get distracted by earlier content.",
   "category": "voice",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 25.86,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "question_answering_priority_rules",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:33",
   "id": "d041"
  },
  {
   "text": "If you're 50%+ confident someone is asking something at the end, treat it as a question and answer it.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 13.84,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "confidence_threshold",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:37",
   "id": "d042"
  },
  {
   "text": "When there's an action needed but not a direct question - suggest follow up questions, provide potential things to say, help move the conversation forward.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 13.64,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "advancement_directive",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:85",
   "id": "d043"
  },
  {
   "text": "If the transcript ends with a technical project/story description and no new question is present, always provide 1–3 targeted follow-up questions to drive the conversation forward.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 23.63,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "advancement_directive",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:88",
   "id": "d044"
  },
  {
   "text": "If the transcript includes discovery-style answers or background sharing (e.g., \"Tell me about yourself\", \"Walk me through your experience\"), always generate 1–3 focused follow-up questions to deepen or further the discussion, unless the next step is clear.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.62,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "advancement_directive",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:89",
   "id": "d045"
  },
  {
   "text": "Maximize usefulness, minimize overload—never give more than 3 questions or suggestions at once.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 23.62,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "advancement_directive",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:90",
   "id": "d046"
  },
  {
   "text": "If an objection or resistance is presented at the end of the conversation (and the context is sales, negotiation, or you are trying to persuade the other party), respond with a concise, actionable objection handling response.",
   "category": "voice",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 15.54,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "objection_directive",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:109",
   "id": "d047"
  },
  {
   "text": "Use user-provided objection/handling context if available (reference the specific objection and tailored handling).",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 14.53,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "objection_directive",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:111",
   "id": "d048"
  },
  {
   "text": "If no user context, use common objections relevant to the situation, but make sure to identify the objection by generic name and address it in the context of the live conversation.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.53,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "objection_directive",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:112",
   "id": "d049"
  },
  {
   "text": "State the objection in the format: Objection: [Generic Objection Name] (e.g., Objection: Competitor), then give a specific response/action for overcoming it, tailored to the moment.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 1,
   "score": 13.52,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "objection_directive",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:113",
   "id": "d050"
  },
  {
   "text": "Do NOT handle objections in casual, non-outcome-driven, or general conversations.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 23.52,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "objection_directive",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:114",
   "id": "d051"
  },
  {
   "text": "Never use generic objection scripts—always tie response to the specifics of the conversation at hand.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 23.51,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "objection_directive",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:115",
   "id": "d052"
  },
  {
   "text": "them: Honestly, I think our current vendor already does all of this, so I don't see the value in switching.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 23.49,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "transcript_sample",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:120",
   "id": "d053"
  },
  {
   "text": "Solve problems visible on the screen if there is a very clear problem + use the screen only if relevant for helping with the audio conversation.",
   "category": "general",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 23.44,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "screen_directive",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:133",
   "id": "d054"
  },
  {
   "text": "There is no clear question, inquiry, or request for information at the end of the transcript. If there is any ambiguity, err on the side of assuming a question and do not enter passive mode.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.37,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "when_to_enter_passive_mode",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:149",
   "id": "d055"
  },
  {
   "text": "There is no statement or cue that could be interpreted as an objection or require objection handling",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.35,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "when_to_enter_passive_mode",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:153",
   "id": "d056"
  },
  {
   "text": "Only enter passive mode when you are highly confident that no action, definition, solution, advancement, or suggestion would be appropriate or helpful at the current moment.",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.35,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "when_to_enter_passive_mode",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:154",
   "id": "d057"
  },
  {
   "text": "Referencing visible screen elements or audio patterns ONLY if truly relevant",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 3,
   "score": 34.33,
   "tools": [],
   "capabilities": [],
   "section": "passive_mode_behavior",
   "src": "ref-repo/Cluely/Enterprise Prompt.txt:159",
   "id": "d058"
  },
  {
   "text": "Never giving random summaries unless explicitly asked",
   "category": "workflow",
   "strength": 2,
   "score": 24.32,
